@baseUrl = http://localhost:6767

### Leaderboard default
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leaderboard

### Leaderboard wins
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leaderboard?category=wins&page=1&limit=10

### Leaderboard win percentage
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leaderboard?category=winPercentage&page=1&limit=10

### Leaderboard matches
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leaderboard?category=matches&page=1&limit=10

### Should fail since this is a invalid leaderboard category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leaderboard?category=score

